<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Chemapol H1 gross profit higher.</title>
<headline>Czech Chemapol H1 gross profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six month period ending June 30, 1997:</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Gross profit	 637.683    vs     474.187</p>
<p> Operational loss   (95.547)   vs    (177.070)</p>
<p> Write-offs	     5.722    vs	 2.668</p>
<p> Basic capital    2,506.404    vs   1,648.878</p>
<p> Assets	    16,548.363    vs  15,254.748</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Chemapol Group a.s., a chemical holding concern. Results are provided by Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, +420-2-2423-0003</p>
<p>	 prague.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
